    },
    "“%@” is no longer applied to any term." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the dialog offered after removing a tag from a term, when that tag was applied to no other term. The argument is the tag's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "« %@ » n'est plus appliqué à aucun terme."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」은(는) 더 이상 어떤 용어에도 적용되어 있지 않습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is no longer linked to anything, so there is nothing to study from it." : {
      "comment" : "A message in a confirmation dialog that appears when a user",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "« %@ » n'est plus lié à rien, il n'y a donc rien à étudier à partir de ce terme."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」은(는) 더 이상 아무것과도 연결되어 있지 않아 학습할 것이 없습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@" : {
